### Land Grants API - HTTP Client

# Local WBD1 fixture: CRN 1300000034, Valley Estate (SBI 300000034).
# Authenticate as this CRN when obtaining defraIdToken for these requests.
# landGrantsUrl, landGrantsAuthToken and defraIdToken use the selected HTTP
# Client environment; keep credentials in http-client.private.env.json.
@testSbi = 300000034
@testCrn = 1300000034
@testSheetId = SD5349
@testParcelId = 3815
@testApplicationId = http-client-wbd1
@testQuantity = 4
# Match availability.unit from getSelectedParcelActions. The local API uses count.
@testQuantityUnit = count

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Health
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health check (no auth required)
# @name getHealth
GET {{landGrantsUrl}}/health

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# MapSelectPageController and SelectActionsPageController
#
# MapSelectPageController GET renders the map; its browser requests trigger
# the parcel-data and bounds lookups below via the Grants UI map handlers.
# Both controllers use fetchActionsForParcel for the selected parcel.
# enabledLandActions is filtered in Grants UI, not sent to the Land Grants API:
# an action appearing here must also be enabled in the grant to appear in the UI.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Map load: sizes and actions for the business's parcels
# @name getMapParcels
# parcelsHandler -> fetchParcels -> parcelsWithSize (when enabledLandActions is set).
# The initial parcel IDs come from the DAL; these are Valley Estate's five mock parcels.
POST {{landGrantsUrl}}/api/v2/parcels
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{landGrantsAuthToken}}
x-forwarded-authorization: {{defraIdToken}}
x-cdp-request-id: {{$uuid}}

{
  "sbi": "{{testSbi}}",
  "parcelIds": ["SD5349-3815", "SD6050-3851", "SD8042-3851", "SD6759-3857", "SD6159-3880"],
  "fields": ["size", "actions"],
  "plannedActions": []
}

### Map load: bounding box used to fit the viewport
# @name locateMapParcels
# parcelsHandler -> fetchParcelTileLocation -> locateParcelTiles.
POST {{landGrantsUrl}}/api/v1/parcel-tiles/locate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{landGrantsAuthToken}}
x-forwarded-authorization: {{defraIdToken}}
x-cdp-request-id: {{$uuid}}

{
  "parcelIds": ["SD5349-3815", "SD6050-3851", "SD8042-3851", "SD6759-3857", "SD6159-3880"]
}

### Map Continue / select-actions GET: selected parcel actions and consent requirements
# @name getSelectedParcelActions
# MapSelectPageController.findParcelsWithNoActions and SelectActionsPageController
# use fetchActionsForParcel -> parcelsWithActions. The map consent lookup also
# uses this request shape. Consent fields are included when their feature flags
# are enabled; remove the corresponding fields to mirror disabled flags.
# WBD1 should have availability.value null (unrestricted), not 0 (unavailable).
POST {{landGrantsUrl}}/api/v2/parcels
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{landGrantsAuthToken}}
x-forwarded-authorization: {{defraIdToken}}
x-cdp-request-id: {{$uuid}}

{
  "sbi": "{{testSbi}}",
  "parcelIds": ["{{testSheetId}}-{{testParcelId}}"],
  "fields": ["actions", "size", "actions.sssiConsentRequired", "actions.heferRequired"],
  "plannedActions": []
}

### Select actions: recompute availability with four ponds selected
# @name getActionsWithWbd1Selection
# SelectActionsPageController.recomputeActionsForState -> fetchActionsWithPlannedActions.
# The browser's live refresh through /api/land-grants/actions/{parcelId} uses
# the same upstream call. Send plannedActions: [] to model deselecting WBD1.
POST {{landGrantsUrl}}/api/v2/parcels
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{landGrantsAuthToken}}
x-forwarded-authorization: {{defraIdToken}}
x-cdp-request-id: {{$uuid}}

{
  "sbi": "{{testSbi}}",
  "parcelIds": ["{{testSheetId}}-{{testParcelId}}"],
  "fields": ["actions", "size", "actions.sssiConsentRequired", "actions.heferRequired"],
  "plannedActions": [
    {
      "actionCode": "WBD1",
      "quantity": {{testQuantity}},
      "unit": "{{testQuantityUnit}}"
    }
  ]
}

### Select actions Continue: validate the selected WBD1 quantity
# @name validateWbd1Selection
# SelectActionsBasePageController.handleApplicationValidation -> validateApplication.
# applicationId is the lowercased grant application reference number in the UI;
# this example uses a separate test identifier. For a full application, include
# every selected parcel and action in landActions.
# This payload uses code (not actionCode) and omits unit, matching the state mapper.
# Grants UI validates positive whole numbers before calling this endpoint.
POST {{landGrantsUrl}}/api/v2/application/validate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{landGrantsAuthToken}}
x-forwarded-authorization: {{defraIdToken}}
x-cdp-request-id: {{$uuid}}

{
  "applicationId": "{{testApplicationId}}",
  "requester": "grants-ui",
  "applicantCrn": "{{testCrn}}",
  "sbi": "{{testSbi}}",
  "landActions": [
    {
      "sheetId": "{{testSheetId}}",
      "parcelId": "{{testParcelId}}",
      "actions": [
        {
          "code": "WBD1",
          "quantity": {{testQuantity}}
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Woodland Management Plan payments
#
# Required headers (see createApiHeadersForLandGrantsBackend in
# backend-auth-helper.js and land-grants.client.js):
#   Content-Type: application/json
#   Authorization: Bearer <token>  (in the app this is the AES-256-GCM
#     encrypted + base64 land-grants token; set landGrantsAuthToken to the
#     value the backend expects for the selected environment)
#   x-forwarded-authorization: <defra id access token>
#   x-cdp-request-id: <trace id> (added by withTraceId; optional here)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Calculate WMP payment for the given parcels
# @name calculateWmpPayment
POST {{landGrantsUrl}}/api/v1/wmp/payments/calculate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{landGrantsAuthToken}}
x-forwarded-authorization: {{defraIdToken}}
x-cdp-request-id: {{$uuid}}

{
  "parcelIds": ["SD6346-3387"],
  "oldWoodlandAreaHa": 126.3397,
  "newWoodlandAreaHa": 0,
  "startDate": "2025-08-05"
}

###

### Calculate WMP payment by total area
# @name calculateWmpPaymentByTotalArea
POST {{landGrantsUrl}}/api/v1/wmp/payments/calculate-by-total-area
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{landGrantsAuthToken}}
x-forwarded-authorization: {{defraIdToken}}
x-cdp-request-id: {{$uuid}}

{
  "totalAreaHa": 126.3397,
  "applicationId": "APP-123",
  "sbi": "123456789",
  "crn": "1234567890"
}

###
